    "body": "I believe this issue has already been reported in #3137 before and fixed in #3146. The fix will be included in the next release. \r\n\r\nAs a workaround until then, you could try inlining the [prerelease fish starship init](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/starship/starship/master/src/init/starship.fish) (you will need to replace `::STARSHIP::` with your starship binary path). But please keep in mind the init will change from time to time.\r\n\r\nPlease re-open this issue if you think it hasn't been addressed.",
